Every TDD test below is **derived from a v2/README requirement**, not from the old plan. Where a module existed in `docs/plans/06-generator.md`, the task notes **what changed for the new design** so the reviewer can confirm the tests assert new behavior. A test that only re-passes the old spec is a defect here.

