**Files:** Create `lib/generator/types.ts`. Test: none (types only; exercised by consumers).

Define the **data contracts** the whole feature shares, matching README §State Management exactly:

```ts
// lib/generator/types.ts
export type UiOccasion = "everyday" | "work" | "weekend" | "evening";
export type Slot = { xPct: number; yPct: number; wPct: number; hPct: number; rotationDeg: number; z: number };
